WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open the first-run setup wizard on an uninitialized Docker clone.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Start setup and review system checks plus detected deployment mode.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Use the safe skip-rendering path because local rendering is unavailable in server mode.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Create a dummy initial administrator with the password hidden.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Finish setup and confirm the application redirects to login.
